<div dir="auto">Hi, Kati.</div>
<div dir="auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir="auto">I read somewhere to contact you or Dan about golf cart issues, so I hope this message is welcome.</div>
<div dir="auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir="auto">My golf cart has a few issues.</div>
<div dir="auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir="auto">The major one is the tent structure around it - the driver side does not zip up. It cannot be sealed (the zipper is completely ripped) and with the constant rain, this means a wet environment while I'm working and potential damage to the unit.
 I've tried protecting it overnight with a tarp but given the wind, this has not worked as well as I'd hoped. It is still getting very wet.</div>
<div dir="auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir="auto">The other issue is related to the motor. It skips so the drive has never been smooth. Charles explained this to me but I can't recall the mechanics. He noted he had this unit last month and it was meant to go in for repair. I don't recall seeing
 any other units up there so I can understand how I ended up with it and I'm fine with the situation, I just want to note it in case you feel it requires attention.</div>
<div dir="auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir="auto">Thanks</div>
<div dir="auto">Sam</div>
